  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You use your power to delve into a creature's mind and break their spirit.</p><p>Choose a creature within <strong>10 spaces</strong> and <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check resisted by the target's <strong>Willpower</strong>.</p><p>If you succeed, the target's <strong>Soul</strong> is reduced by an amount equal to the difference in successes until the start of your next turn.</p><p>Furthermore, the target cannot regain <strong>Resolve</strong>, and they cannot take extra actions in combat such with resolve or the use of a legendary ability (with the exception of <em>Epic Resistance</em>).</p><p>You may spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> at the start of your turn to sustain this effect.</p><p>Additionally, you have <strong>Advantage</strong> on <strong>Intimidation</strong> checks against the target for as long as they can sense you.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.v733YwrsChI9VAjI]{Stormcaller's Despair}</p>",
